# An aggregate under a guard is computed by the body over the group's rows, not by the group.
use planner

probe plan
  explain from o in orders group o by o.user into g
    select { user: g.key, big: if count(x for x in g) > 1 then sum(x.total for x in g) else 0 }
----
Set
  reads orders.Order
  Pipeline
    One row
    Bind
      Group 1 aggregates, keeps rows
        Pipeline
          Scan orders.Order
          Emit
    Unnest
    Bind
      Let
        If
          Aggregate sum, total
            Pipeline
              One row
              Unnest
              Emit
          Compute
        Compute
    Emit
